			"id": "bcb609b8-ba06-45d8-99ea-9ac41072dfdb",
			"aliasName": "Text_2",
			"text": "The battery can only be exchanged when the C-IPC is off!"
		},
		{
			"type": "textElement",
			"id": "1e0bc3cc-d3b5-4f0f-b0f2-678924df93b7",
			"aliasName": "Text_3",
			"text": "To exchange the battery, remove the screws and carefully tilt the cover to the front."
		},
		{
			"type": "textElement",
			"id": "97e11a8f-7ef9-4e34-82d6-68b2bcab5bd1",
			"aliasName": "Text_4",
			"text": "Pull the old battery out of the fixture and replace it with the new one.|When inserting the new battery, make sure the polarity is correct.|Finally, replace the cover and tighten the screws."
		},
		{
			"type": "textElement",
			"id": "45993711-7310-4c62-bcdd-402e2157136a",
			"aliasName": "Text_5",
